This project reviewed, but did not copy, the MIT-licensed notebooks at
https://github.com/Ren-Research/Making-AI-Less-Thirsty (Copyright (c) 2023
Ren-Research). Those notebooks compute training-run water from hourly
datacenter WUE/PUE and EIA fuel mix — they do not expose a per-token formula —
so aqua-tokens does not include their source. The conversion rates live in
water-methodology.json as a labeled interpolation from the published paper,
not a port of that code.

If a future version ports their calculation, the MIT copyright notice from
Ren-Research must be reproduced here in full.
